# Presage SmartSpectra (camera breath detection) is TEMPORARILY DISABLED: its credits ran out.
# The server ignores PRESAGE_API_KEY and never loads the SDK unless PRESAGE_ENABLED is 1 (or
# true); set it to 1 to re-enable. The game has its own build-time switch, VITE_PRESAGE_ENABLED,
# also off by default; set it to 1 to re-enable. Vite reads it from the shell or game/.env when
# building, not from this file (production: the repo variable, see deploy/SETUP.md).
PRESAGE_ENABLED=
# VITE_PRESAGE_ENABLED=
# Presage SmartSpectra key: https://physiology.presagetech.com/portal/dashboard
PRESAGE_API_KEY=
SENSOR_PORT=8787
# PEARL market (sensor/market.mjs). Dev: `npm run market` on MARKET_PORT=8795, which Vite proxies;
# `npm start` serves it itself at /api/market on PORT.
# Empty = server mode (fallback). Set to the deployed fish_market program id for program mode.
FISH_MARKET_PROGRAM_ID=
# player_state program the co-signed fish mint records each catch in (record_catch, server mode).
# Empty = the devnet program EUzJF8sYEMiqM2XV7FrPoPiQ89VHJvJ4VeeFtuXVaWJQ (contracts/DEPLOYED.md).
# PLAYER_STATE_PROGRAM_ID=
# Oracle keypair for program mode, relative to the repo root (created if missing).
# MARKET_ORACLE_KEYPAIR=sensor/.market-oracle.json
# Folder for the market's keypair and state, relative to the repo root (default: sensor).
# MARKET_DIR=sensor
# Solana RPC for every server-side call (market, fish collection, payouts, burns).
# Empty = VITE_SOLANA_RPC, else the public https://api.devnet.solana.com, which answers HTTP 429
# under a bulk sell. Production: a dedicated devnet RPC from a provider. Its URL usually holds an
# API key, so set it ONLY in the server's .env: never commit it, never put it in a VITE_* variable.
# SOLANA_RPC=
# Market RPC calls in flight at once (default 3); a 429 pauses them all. Raise only on a paid plan.
# SOLANA_RPC_CONCURRENCY=3

# Serve mode only (`npm start`); see README "Self-hosting"
# PORT=8794
# HOST=127.0.0.1
# MAX_LIVE_SESSIONS=1
# MAX_CONN_PER_IP=8
# SENSOR_RECORD=1
